  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nEach attack grants this
    ally 1% attack speed, up to 20% this wave.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Damage
    correction: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nAn
    estuary pilot whose captain demanded guarantees no uncertain tide could give.
    They left that ship. They offer passage with risks spoken aloud and seek a crew
    willing to hear an honest forecast.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic
    personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their
    stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: tidal, resolve.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge
    unless the talent forbids it."
